        "reason": "Corrosion cases require local oxidation/reduction equations and charge pathways. The full prerequisite additionally derives arbitrary aqueous redox equations via oxidation numbers and acidic permanganate/H+ balancing. These extra operations are unnecessary for the given neutral oxygen-corrosion and sacrificial-anode cases."
